<div class="page-heading admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Resilience</span><h1>Backup & recovery</h1><p>Create an encrypted archive of MySQL data and protected applicant files.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= url('admin/backups') ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><button class="button button-primary" data-confirm="Create a new encrypted full backup now? This may take time on a large installation.">+ Create encrypted backup</button></form></div><div class="warning-box backup-warning"><span>!</span><div><b>A backup is useful only when it can be restored.</b><p>Download completed archives to a separate encrypted location, retain the matching APP_KEY securely, test restoration on an isolated server and never keep the only copy beside the live application.</p></div></div><div class="backup-summary"><article class="card"><span>Encryption</span><b>AES-256-GCM</b><small>Archive authenticated against tampering</small></article><article class="card"><span>Contents</span><b>Data + files</b><small>SQL dump, manifest and protected uploads</small></article><article class="card"><span>Integrity</span><b>SHA-256</b><small>Checksum recorded in audit data</small></article><article class="card"><span>Restore mode</span><b>Administrator-led</b><small>Use an isolated environment and maintenance window</small></article></div><section class="card application-table-card"><div class="card-heading backup-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Backup history</span><h2>Encrypted archives</h2></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Created</th><th>Filename</th><th>Size</th><th>Checksum</th><th>Initiated by</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($backups as $backup):?><tr><td><?= format_date($backup['created_at'],true) ?></td><td><b><?= e($backup['filename']) ?></b></td><td><?= $backup['size_bytes']?number_format($backup['size_bytes']/1024/1024,2).' MB':'—' ?></td><td><code><?= $backup['checksum_sha256']?e(substr($backup['checksum_sha256'],0,16)).'…':'—' ?></code></td><td><?= e($backup['initiated_by_name']?:'System') ?></td><td><span class="status-pill status-<?= e($backup['status']) ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($backup['status'])) ?></span><?php if($backup['error_message']):?><small class="completion-small"><?= e($backup['error_message']) ?></small><?php endif?></td><td><?php if($backup['status']==='completed'):?><a class="button button-sm button-outline" href="<?= url('admin/backups/'.$backup['id'].'/download') ?>">Download</a><?php endif?></td></tr><?php endforeach?></tbody></table><?php if(!$backups):?><div class="empty-state"><span>↓</span><h2>No backup has been created</h2><p>Create the first encrypted backup after configuration, then test your recovery procedure.</p></div><?php endif?></div></section>
